    "scenesThatPass": [
      "SYBIL THORNDIKE: That was perfect, Marilyn. You're Elsie to the life! MARILYN smiles awkwardly, not really believing her but SYBIL carries on with complete c…\nMARILYN: Can I?",
      "MARILYN: I can't do this. I can't.\nPAULA: You can do it. You can't fail. You will have more pain, you will suffer more but you will create. All you need is time.\nPAULA: Remember, Marilyn, a tree is never just a tree. What kind of tree is Elsie? An elm tree? A birch tree?",
      "PAULA: You have no idea of your position in the world, Marilyn. You are the greatest actress there's ever been. Not just actress. The greatest woma…\nPAULA: It's hard now, but believe me you will survive this and go on to better things. Your life is ahead of you. You're young, just beginning.\nMARILYN: I'm so tired of feeling scared. Life is so shitty. I hate it. It hurts too much."
    ]
